    "title": "The big trap: wissen or kennen?",
    "explanation": "Wissen: facts, often + clause (dass, wo, wie). Kennen: people, places, things you're familiar with.",
    "wrong": {
      "german": "Ich weiß Maria.",
      "verdict": "A person: kennen."
